  data: {
    LLM: "Keep the Seven of Hearts until the very end of the 'No Hearts' round. It is your only escape from taking a large point penalty if someone leads the suit when you are low.\n\n'Old Man' Trapping: In the 'No Red King' round, if you hold the Red King, you MUST try to empty your hand of other Hearts as quickly as possible. Once void, you can dump the Red King on any other heart lead safely.\n\nSuta Sequencing: In the shedding round, don't just play your cards because you can. Hold onto a card that 'blocks' your opponent's sequence if you know they have the card immediately following yours.",
    Player: "Keep the Seven of Hearts until the very end of the 'No Hearts' round. It is your only escape from taking a large point penalty if someone leads the suit when you are low.\n\n'Old Man' Trapping: In the 'No Red King' round, if you hold the Red King, you MUST try to empty your hand of other Hearts as quickly as possible. Once void, you can dump the Red King on any other heart lead safely.\n\nSuta Sequencing: In the shedding round, don't just play your cards because you can. Hold onto a card that 'blocks' your opponent's sequence if you know they have the card immediately following yours.",
